## Phase 9 — Bot: Random

**Objective:** Build the simplest possible bot as a baseline and API smoke test.

### Tasks
1. Get legal moves from API.
2. Pick one at random.
3. Submit it.

### Why This Matters
- If this bot crashes, your API has bugs.
- This establishes a performance baseline: "a random bot scores X on average." Every future bot must beat this.
- Run 100 games of 4 random bots. Record average scores. This is your first dataset.

### You're done when
- 4 random bots can play 100 games to completion without errors.
- You have average score data.

